# Plan — {{DOMAIN_NAME}}

Turn an approved spec into a plan detailed enough that a fresh session with zero context
executes it task by task without asking questions.

Write for a skilled engineer who knows nothing about this repo or this problem, and who
reads tasks out of order. Every name, command, and expected output on the page. If a step
needs knowledge that lives only in this conversation, the plan has failed.

## The one hard rule

Write the plan. Do not implement it. No code beyond what the plan contains, nothing
installed, nothing run against anything real. Execution is a fresh session — that is the
only real test of whether the plan is complete.

